# Task scenario "Flowers Incorporated" (brief/TASK.md), step by step.
# Run the requests top to bottom: click "Send Request" above each one.
# Needs the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) and the app running on localhost:8080.
#
# Re-running: field registration answers 409 the second time, because the tenant already has the
# fields. Change @tenant to start fresh (or run the cleanup request at the bottom of the file
# plus a database reset: `docker compose down -v && docker compose up -d`).

@host = http://localhost:8080
@tenant = tenant_123
@customer = cus_123

### 1. Register generic field "dob" (expect 200)
POST {{host}}/generic_fields
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "dob", "type": "DATETIME" }

### 2. Register generic field "vip" (expect 200)
POST {{host}}/generic_fields
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "vip", "type": "BOOL" }

### 3. Register generic field "score" (expect 200)
POST {{host}}/generic_fields
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "score", "type": "INTEGER" }

### 4. Create customer (expect 200)
POST {{host}}/customers
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{customer}}",
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Smith",
  "generic_fields": {
    "dob": "1990-01-01T00:00:00",
    "vip": true,
    "score": 100
  }
}

### 5. Fetch customer (expect 200, same data as created)
GET {{host}}/customers/{{customer}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### 6. Update customer (expect 200): dob null = removed, score omitted = kept
PATCH {{host}}/customers/{{customer}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": null,
  "last_name": null,
  "generic_fields": {
    "dob": null,
    "vip": false
  }
}

### 7. Fetch after update (expect Lewis Bull, generic_fields = { vip: false, score: 100 })
GET {{host}}/customers/{{customer}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### 8. Delete customer (expect 204)
DELETE {{host}}/customers/{{customer}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

### 9. Fetch deleted customer (expect 404 CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{host}}/customers/{{customer}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
